    turnFlow: "Lead any tile. Players in turn must match an open end; if no match is possible they pass. The first double played is the only spinner and creates the cross-style expansion pattern. After each play, score immediately if exposed ends total 5, 10, 15, 20, 25 or 30. A hand ends when someone dominoes or all players are blocked. Then each player's remaining pips are rounded to nearest five and subtracted from that player's score.",
